{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"curvy-trigonous-anteater","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Observation (2026-11-19 PST)\n`test.yml` dispatched on main at `92d3f373e2c` (run 44503581058), job `sweep (windows)` 135490319213: 14 failed, 20,016 passed.\n- 12 also failed on main at `3f47117c97b` (run 44487190183, job 135433617476, 13 failures). They compare backslash paths against forward-slash expectations or vice versa:\n  - `tests/unit/store/test_store_paths.py::test_exactly_one_rebar_dir_definition_under_src`\n  - `tests/unit/test_repo_root_from_package_guard.py::test_the_only_sanctioned_site_is_the_resolver_seam`\n  - `tests/unit/test_repo_root_from_tracker_guard.py` (2 tests)\n  - `tests/unit/test_single_definition_helpers.py::test_the_argparse_positive_int_is_defined_once_and_its_namesake_survives`\n  - `tests/unit/test_uv_pin_guard.py` (7 tests): the expected message uses `infra\\compose\\Dockerfile.svc`, while the script prints `infra/compose/Dockerfile.svc`.\n- 2 are new since `04e175d70eb` (ticket `livid-painful-mosquito`, closed): `tests/unit/test_git_ssh_output_encoding.py::test_run_git_encodes_str_stdin_as_utf8[process-group]` and `[subprocess-run]` (blob SHA mismatch on Windows, which points at a newline translation of the stdin text).\n- The previous run's one other failure, `test_store_commit_maintenance_bd66.py::test_write_survives_foreground_maintenance_repack` (worker crash), did not recur.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `sweep (windows)` on main passes, or each remaining failure has its own ticket; verified by the job result of a `gh workflow run test.yml --ref main` dispatch.","id":"e816-b30a-6a5c-4ae4","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":["windows"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Windows sw